vcpkg: Install HarfBuzz for Android

Meta/CMake/check_for_dependencies.cmake requires HarfBuzz on every platform, but
vcpkg.json only lists it for Linux, BSD, Windows and macOS, so configuring for
Android fails with "Could not find a package configuration file provided by
harfbuzz".

Requirement: BLD-005

diff --git a/vcpkg.json b/vcpkg.json
index 574dba01..c3b6e48c 100644
--- a/vcpkg.json
+++ b/vcpkg.json
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@
     },
     {
       "name": "harfbuzz",
-      "platform": "linux | bsd | windows",
+      "platform": "linux | bsd | windows | android",
       "features": [
         "freetype",
         "icu"
